WEBVTT

00:08:55.447 --> 00:09:00.119
Does she not understand how good
that sugary sweet milk was at the bottom?

00:09:01.245 --> 00:09:02.621
That's interesting.

00:09:03.664 --> 00:09:05.916
That's a really delicious flavor of milk.

00:09:05.916 --> 00:09:07.334
It moved me.

00:09:07.376 --> 00:09:09.336
It made sense to me,

00:09:09.378 --> 00:09:11.714
but would it make sense to other people?

00:09:12.881 --> 00:09:14.341
Figured I'd give it a try.

00:09:15.217 --> 00:09:16.635
So I went back to the kitchen

00:09:16.635 --> 00:09:18.971
and made the equivalent
of a giant bowl of cereal.

00:09:19.013 --> 00:09:21.640
I strained out all that delicious milk,

00:09:21.682 --> 00:09:23.601
and I spun it into ice cream.

00:09:24.018 --> 00:09:25.185
Put it on the menu.

00:09:26.645 --> 00:09:28.439
And I've got to tell you, even now,

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:30.399
people stop me on the street